#### 4. Mystery Guest
**Ref:** van Deursen et al., "Refactoring Test Code" (2001); Peruma et al.  
**Test:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 139)

```csharp
// ❌ Hard-coded absolute path to external file
File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv")
```

**Risk:** Fails on any machine that doesn't have `C:\TestData\orders.csv`. Also constitutes **Resource Optimism** (no existence check). Will always fail on Linux CI.

**Fix — inline the test data:**
```csharp
[TestMethod]
public void ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    var csv = "SKU-1,2\nSKU-2,1\nSKU-3,3\nSKU-4,1\nSKU-5,2";
    var orders = processor.ImportOrders(csv);
    Assert.AreEqual(5, orders.Count);
}
```

