#### 7. Sensitive Equality
**Ref:** Peruma et al., ESEC/FSE 2020  
**Test:** `GetOrderSummary_ReturnsFormattedString` (line 122)

```csharp
// ❌ Asserts against ToString() output — brittle to formatting changes
Assert.AreEqual("Order ORD-001: 1 item(s), Total: $99.99", summary.ToString());
```

**Risk:** Any change to formatting, currency symbol, or locale breaks this test even if the summary object is correct.

**Fix — assert on structured properties instead:**
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("ORD-001", summary.OrderId);
Assert.AreEqual(1, summary.ItemCount);
Assert.AreEqual(99.99m, summary.Total);
```

