## ✅ Smell-Free Test

**`ValidateOrder_NullOrder_ThrowsArgumentNullException`** (line 155) is clean:
- Uses `Assert.ThrowsException<T>` (framework-native exception assertion)
- Asserts on a specific property (`ex.ParamName`)
- No external dependencies, no magic numbers, no control flow

This is the model to follow.

